WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.055
Graph time-series prediction asks a model to
forecast the next graph in a sequence,

00:00:04.135 --> 00:00:08.190
not just a label.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:12.325
Standard graph networks emit node or edge probabilities,

00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:16.460
which can't naturally express the structural
operations that transform one graph into the next.
